$DATUM 123-91-1
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM A mixture of 26b (40.4 mg, 0.10 mmol), PdCl2 (2 mg, 0.01 mmol, 10 mol%),
PPh3 (5 mg, 0.02 mmol, 20 mol%), Cs2CO3 (82 mg, 0.25 mmol, 2.5 eq),
norbornene (57 mg, 0.6 mmol, 6.0 eq), 8a (0.121 g, 0.6 mmol, 6.0 eq) in
1,4-dioxane (1.0 ml) in a schlenk tube was stirred at 85°C for 20 h.
After being cooled to room temperature the mixture was filtered through a
plug of Celite eluting with ethyl acetate (3×10 ml). The filtrate was
washed with brine (10 ml), dried over sodium sulfate, and concentrated.
The crude product was purified by column chromatography (10% ethyl
acetate/ hexanes then 50% hexanes/ dichloromethane). 27b (15.9 mg, 40 %).
1H NMR (400 MHz, CDCl3) δ 9.46 (s, 1 H), 7.84 (d, J = 7.6 Hz, 1 H),
7.59-7.40 (m, 3 H), 6.79 (s, 1 H), 5.79 (dd, J = 16.4, 10.4 Hz, 1 H),
5.15 (bs, 1 H), 4.72 (bs, 1 H), 4.71(d, J = 17.2 Hz, 1 H), 4.18-4.04 (m,
1 H), 3.99 (q, J = 6.9 Hz, 2 H), 2.21 (t, J = 8.0 Hz, 2 H), 2.15-2.01 (m,
1 H), 2.00-1.84 (m, 2 H), 1.84-1.55 (m, 3 H), 1.15 (t, J = 7.2 Hz, 3 H);
13C NMR (100 MHz, CDCl3) δ 179.0, 173.0, 149.9, 139.0, 133.5, 131.5,
130.7, 130.6, 128.4, 125.8, 124.1, 118.2, 115.5, 60.3, 46.1, 43.0, 32.0,
30.0, 29.1, 18.3, 14.1; HRMS (ACPI) calcd for C22H25O5N2 [M++H] 397.1758,
found 397.1766.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM chemoselective, key step, Catellani reaction
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Pd-Catalyzed Chemoselective Catellani Ortho-Arylation of Iodopyrroles:
Rapid Total Synthesis of Rhazinal
