$DATUM 4-(tert-Butyldimethylsilyloxy)-6-methoxy-2,3,3a,8a-tetrahydrofuro[2,3-b]benzofuran-2-one
20a To a solution of arylbromide 18 (290 mg, 0.697 mmol) in dry, degassed
benzene (13 mL) was added a degassed solution of triphenyltin hydride
(0.36 mL, 1.4 mmol) in benzene (10 mL), followed by 1.0 M triethylboron
(70 μL, 0.07 mmol) and oxygen (100 μL via syringe). The addition of
triethylboron/oxygen was repeated after 1h at room temperature, then the
reaction mixture was allowed to stir at room temperature overnight. The
reaction mixture is concentrated in vacuo, and the resulting oil
chromatographed eluting with 1:6 ethyl acetate: hexanes to afford 20a (77
mg, 33%) as a colorless liquid. IR (film): 2930, 1795, 1630, 1599 cm-1.
1H-NMR (300 MHz, CDCl3): 6.48 (d, J = 6.1 Hz, 1H), 6.16 (d, J = 2.0 Hz,
1H), 6.00 (d, J = 2.0 Hz, 1H), 4.20 (q., J = 5.8 Hz, 2H), 3.74 (s, 1H),
2.94 (m, 2H), 0.98 (s, 9H), 0.28 (s, 6H). 13C-NMR (75 MHz, CDCl3): 176.0,
164.1, 161.0, 154.8, 110.2, 109.9, 101.4, 91.7, 57.1, 42.2, 34.7, 27.1,
27.0, 19.4, -2.7, -3.0. HRMS, Calc'd for C17H24SiO5: 336.1393. Found:
336.1395.
