$DATUM Methyl 3-phenyl-2-((2E,4E)-5-phenylpenta-2,4-dienamido)propanoate (5).
Lithium chloride (5.8 mg, 0.14 mmol), HBF4P(t-Bu)3 (4.0 mg, 0.014 mmol),
(E)-diphenyl styryl phosphate (73.0 mg, 0.21 mmol), methyl
2-acrylamido-3-phenyl propanoate (30.0 mg, 0.14 mmol), Cy2NMe (59 μL,
0.28 mmol), PdCl2(COD) (2.0 mg, 0.007 mmol) dissolved in DMF (3 mL) were
reacted for 24 h at 100°C. NMR analysis on crude reaction mixture after
workup showed 40% conversion. Yield not determined. 1H NMR (400 MHz,
CD3CN) δ (ppm) 7.49 (m, 2H), 7.38-7.21 (m, 9H), 7.01-6.93 (m, 2H), 6.87
(bd, 1H, NH, J = 8.0 Hz), 6.11 (d, 1H, J = 15.2 Hz), 4.76 (dt, 1H, J =
8.0, 6.0 Hz), 3.66 (s, 3H), 3.17 (dd, 1H, J = 14.0, 6.0 Hz), 3.00 (dd,
1H, J = 13.6, 8.4 Hz). 13C NMR (100 MHz, CD3CN) δ (ppm) 173.1, 166.4,
141.7, 139.9, 138.1, 137.5, 130.2, 129.8, 129.7, 129.4, 127.9, 127.8,
127.6, 124.9, 54.8, 52.7, 38.2. HRMS C21H21NO3 [M+Na+]: 358.1419 found:
358.1412.
