3.2 Hz), 130.28 (d, J(C,P) = 1.8 Hz), 130.14 (d, J(C,P) = 2.3 Hz),
129.42, 129.00 (2C), 128.90, 128.86 (d, J(C,P) = 1.6 Hz), 128.83 (2C),
128.43 (2C), 128.35 (d, J(C,P) = 1.9 Hz), 128.14, 128.07, 127.99, 127.92,
127.87, 127.81, 127.79, 127.61, 127.46, 127.32, 127.21, 127.15, 127.10,
127.05, 127.02, 126.81 (2C), 126.60, 126.49, 126.25, 126.16 (2C), 125.98,
125.42, 123.30, 122.43, 120.24, 65.60, 64.31, 59.89 (dd, 3J(C,P) = 4.2,
1.4 Hz), 43.12, 40.99 (dd, 2J(C,P) = 103.2, 4.3 Hz), 14.90 (dd, 3J(C,P) =
4.6, 2.3 Hz); 31P NMR (202 MHz, CDCl3) δ 22.20 (d, 2J(P,P) = 44.1 Hz,
1.00P), 19.40 (d, 2J(P,P) = 44.1 Hz, 0.96P); [α= +203, [α= +199, [α [αand
[αnot possible due to sample absorbance (c = 0.46 in CHCl3); IR (thin
film) 3057, 2957, 2926, 2856, 1706, 1671, 1610, 1482, 1436, 1343, 1312,
1292, 1181, 1127, 1096, 1077, 1004, 946, 745, 695 cm-1; LRMS (ESI+) Calcd
for C71H55N2O4P2Pd (M+H)+: 1167.3. Found: 1167.5. X-ray quality crystals
were obtained from a solution of 3α in MeOH (See Supporting Information,
